# Chub Toad blocks one member of an attacking band and so blocks both (CR 702.22h), but it blocks once: its "whenever this
# creature blocks" triggers once (CR 509.3a), so it is 3/3, not 5/5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Memnite
Benalish Hero
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Chub Toad
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Benalish Hero.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Chub Toad.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Benalish Hero > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot2.Block(Chub Toad > Benalish Hero)
? Combat.Blocks.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Chub Toad.Power = 3
? Bot2.Battlefield.Chub Toad.Toughness = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

